Modified file: app/src/pkjs/lib/reminders.js
Retains the generic timeline pin and reminder layout. Replaces immediate
insertion, random identifiers and reminder-list storage with validated drafts,
explicit confirmation, persistent recovery identity and local-pin insertion.
Removes transcript logging and unrelated integrations.

No upstream media assets, third-party dependencies or native Android source
were imported. The watch UI, parser, controller and tests are new.
